{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12107150","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1210715001:0":{"text":"아, 너구나. 남의 대화 엿듣는 걸 좋아하나 봐?","source_cn":"啊，是你。你很喜欢偷听吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C517411FDC63387","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210715002:0":{"text":"나라, 넌 방금 두 개의 재료를 허비했어.","source_cn":"奈拉，你浪费了两个材料。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DBB0A7EA4C71D0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210715003:0":{"text":"내가 잡은 녀석들이니까 내 마음대로 할 거야. 선장이 그래도 된다고 했어!","source_cn":"那两个家伙是我抓的，任我处置，船长说我有这个权利！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3123D32DEE8B70FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210715004:0":{"text":"... 곧 결전의 날이야. 선장이 진귀한 힘을 너에게 썼으니, 실망시키지 마.","source_cn":"……决战日快到了，船长把那么珍贵的力量用在了你身上，别...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD71967AFD3995192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210715005:0":{"text":"잔소리 그만해! 지겨워 죽겠으니까.","source_cn":"真吵啊，这些话早都听腻了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE728BA3013531394","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210715006:0":{"text":"내가 봤을 땐... 선장이 실망할까 봐 두려워하는 건 너 같은데?","source_cn":"我看是你……很害怕让他失望吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86E62FD4F2B111B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210715007:0":{"text":"웃기시네!","source_cn":"真是无礼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FFEFBE70716054B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210715008:0":{"text":"선장이 말리지 않았다면 진작에 네 머리를 몇 번이고 베어서 갈고리에 걸어놨을 거야. 얼마나 재밌을까!","source_cn":"要不是船长拦着，你的头早被我割下来十次了。串在钩索上会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5471649283677E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210715009:0":{"text":"됐어. 난 분명히 알려줬으니, 네가 알아서 해.","source_cn":"够了。该提醒的我都提醒了，你好自为之。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E394BC5EA7770BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210715010:0":{"text":"아하하. 잘 가!","source_cn":"啊哈哈，慢走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF1C5E713267DA6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210715011:0":{"text":"이봐, 이 두 사람을... 어디 보자...","source_cn":"来人，把这两个人……我想想……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70357E2E39BF2BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210715012:0":{"text":"남자는 매달고, 밧줄은 여자에게 줘.","source_cn":"男的吊起来，绳子给女的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76722A21D16A9777","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210715013:0":{"text":"어이! 아까 네가 한 거짓말 때문에 이 여잔 지금 널 죽여버리고 싶을 거야. 네 운명이 달린 밧줄을 이 여자한테 줄 건데, 과연 너를 살려줄지, 죽게 내버려둘지 한번 보자고. 재밌겠지?","source_cn":"嘿！你刚骗了她，她恨不能杀了你。我把掌握你命运的绳子给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C18754B4B5939FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210715014:0":{"text":"안 돼! 그러지마! 난 그럼 죽을 거야... 제발, 제발!","source_cn":"不！别！我会死的——不要，不要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3095E8530D68DD43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1210715015:0":{"text":"하하하...! 나한테 빌지 말고, 이 여자한테 빌어야지!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈……！求我，不如求她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE10F73EC4577C96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210715016:0":{"text":"하하... 이제 슬슬 질리네. 다른 재미를 찾으러 가야겠어.","source_cn":"哈哈…这俩人没意思了，去找点别的乐子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAD64771E0031853","variant_s